          <choice_text>ㄱ, ㄷ</choice_text>
          <commentary>나프탈렌은 증발연소이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>ㄱ, ㅁ</choice_text>
          <commentary>ㄱ, ㅁ이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>ㄴ, ㄹ</choice_text>
          <commentary>유황은 증발연소, 목탄은 표면연소이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
